_draft_selection:acb2351e84ee5ddc12fe0218","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_f76f9971b2e912d7b623:r3:8c781ae0091a9043"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260922163457_ba25e49c","content_status":"partial","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_f76f9971b2e912d7b623:revision:3","quote":"目标研究人群：18–65岁重度抑郁障碍成人，在稳定SSRI治疗下当前发作应答不足。","quote_sha256":"ec1efee6c907a9511655d17f8f7a050f373cbda851ade5106b1f82e97d4b76d8","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_f76f9971b2e912d7b623:r3:8c781ae0091a9043","span_id":"span_population"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_f76f9971b2e912d7b623:revision:3","quote":"研究人群概述：18–65岁重度抑郁障碍成人，当前发作在足量足疗程且稳定的SSRI治疗下应答不足。","quote_sha256":"280e4729aaa5b77fa18ca0f9b637586f5bc85ed5bd43cb0d3b796f3866aefa1f","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_f76f9971b2e912d7b623:r3:8c781ae0091a9043","span_id":"span_population_overview"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_f76f9971b2e912d7b623:revision:3","quote":"入选标准模块：符合重度抑郁障碍诊断；当前发作持续至少8周；基线MADRS总分≥26；筛选前SSRI剂量稳定至少4周。","quote_sha256":"ecfe9a8a38d3e3a05ff5dc2209a8946e1d520e7d9cc90747e9ffc9545a3b7c72","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_f76f9971b2e912d7b623:r3:8c781ae0091a9043","span_id":"span_inclusion"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_f76f9971b2e912d7b623:revision:3","quote":"排除标准模块：双相障碍或精神病性障碍；近期有迫切自杀风险；当前物质使用障碍；研究者判断不适合参加。","quote_sha256":"61c4b391abde05d4c0c8281ca5bbc537932bb52b7771bab45ce2a5f91fc246c4","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_f76f9971b2e912d7b623:r3:8c781ae0091a9043","span_id":"span_exclusion"}],"evidence_span_ids":["span_population","span_population_overview","span_inclusion","span_exclusion"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":4},"gap_items":[{"action":"补充完整入选/排除标准操作化细则后，细化诊断标准版本、实验室阈值、避孕要求等条目。","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_5_full_eligibility_criteria","missing_source_classes":["完整入选/排除标准操作化细则","诊断标准版本"],"target":"5 研究人群"},{"action":"补充“足量足疗程且稳定SSRI治疗”的具体剂量与疗程定义。","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_5_ssri_adequacy_definition","missing_source_classes":["SSRI治疗充分性定义"],"target":"5 研究人群"}],"heading":"研究人群","missing_source_classes":["完整入选/排除标准操作化细则","SSRI治疗充分性定义","诊断标准版本"],"proposal_text":"本研究目标人群为18–65岁重度抑郁障碍成人，当前发作在足量足疗程且稳定的SSRI治疗下应答不足。入选标准包括：符合重度抑郁障碍诊断；当前发作持续至少8周；基线MADRS总分≥26；筛选前SSRI剂量稳定至少4周。排除标准包括：双相障碍或精神病性障碍；近期有迫切自杀风险；当前物质使用障碍；研究者判断不适合参加。上述人群界定对应于在稳定SSRI治疗基础上评价合成试验药C辅助治疗疗效与安全性的研究目的。","rationale":"已确认研究事实给出目标研究人群、研究人群概述、入选标准模块和排除标准模块，本章据此写入年龄范围、诊断、发作持续时间、MADRS阈值和SSRI稳定要求。完整操作化细则及“足量足疗程”具体定义未在允许来源中给出，需医学作者核对。","review_advisories":["本节复述高影响研究设计（研究人群）；请在合并设计摘要中统一核对。"],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_0cec66a7da6e_64a470648d255819","section_number":"5","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:acb2351e84ee5ddc12fe0218","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_f76f9971b2e912d7b623:r3:8c781ae0091a9043"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260922163457_ba25e49c","content_status":"complete","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_f76f9971b2e912d7b623:revision:3","quote":"样本量策略：假设组间MADRS变化差异为3分、标准差8分、双侧α=0.05、把握度90%、1:1随机并考虑15%失访，计划约170例；合成参数仅用于功能验收。","quote_sha256":"4cb86724706b86fefa4b2d8c1103f5898bb8306adf9c285c818b89230bafa237","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_f76f9971b2e912d7b623:r3:8c781ae0091a9043","span_id":"span_sample_size"},{"locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_0cec66a7da6e_92dc32ead2551dda:full-draft:acb2351e84ee5ddc12fe0218","quote":"当前正文=假设组间MADRS变化差异为3分、标准差8分、双侧α=0.05、把握度90%、1:1随机并考虑15%失访，计划约170例；合成参数仅用于功能验收。","quote_sha256":"fdce81a47d376f95baeeb634e5e79809a1ab84cb5167797ef4ba8e86b768dac4","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:acb2351e84ee5ddc12fe0218","span_id":"span_sel_51_current"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_f76f9971b2e912d7b623:revision:3","quote":"主要终点：第8周MADRS总分较基线变化。","quote_sha256":"7d24fedbdedcfe8cc33346a0687eeeaf0a92a196d921655654ce68ade2fb9d37","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_f76f9971b2e912d7b623:r3:8c781ae0091a9043","span_id":"span_primary_endpoint"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_f76f9971b2e912d7b623:revision:3","quote":"统计分析策略：主要终点采用MMRM，固定效应包括治疗组、访视、治疗组×访视、中心及基线MADRS，报告第8周最小二乘均值差、95%置信区间和双侧P值，以优效性为目标。不开展期中分析；安全性集按实际治疗分析。","quote_sha256":"356a405be343840d33b7adf7aabf02ee4ec71e29b6461a7d8ea1278d46458781","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_f76f9971b2e912d7b623:r3:8c781ae0091a9043","span_id":"span_stats"}],"evidence_span_ids":["span_sample_size","span_sel_51_current","span_primary_endpoint","span_stats"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":3},"gap_items":[],"heading":"计划入组人数","missing_source_classes":[],"proposal_text":"本研究计划入组约170例受试者，按1:1随机分配至合成试验药C辅助组或匹配安慰剂辅助组。样本量估算假设组间MADRS总分较基线变化差异为3分、标准差为8分、双侧α=0.05、把握度为90%，并考虑15%失访。该样本量用于支持评价合成试验药C辅助治疗当前抗抑郁治疗应答不足的重度抑郁障碍的优效性；主要分析针对第8周MADRS总分较基线变化，采用重复测量模型并报告最小二乘均值差、95%置信区间和双侧P值。","rationale":"已确认研究事实给出计划约170例、1:1随机、MADRS变化差异3分、标准差8分、双侧α=0.05、把握度90%和15%失访假设，并给出主要终点及MMRM分析策略；本章据此写入样本量和估算参数。医学作者需复核失访假设和样本量计算与最终统计分析计划的一致性。","review_advisories":["本节提及高影响设计信息（α、样本量、计划入组）；系统未把重复提及升级为强制确认。"],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_0cec66a7da6e_de7df5003046581d","section_number":"5.1","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:acb2351e84ee5ddc12fe0218","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_f76f9971b2e912d7b623:r3:8c781ae0091a9043"]}],"source_bindings":[{"content_sha256":"6c2028b3dcab4c09e410c8f74c4a3db48a60044d0ba4f73fc0b8c9b044393655","locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_0cec66a7da6e_92dc32ead2551dda:full-draft:acb2351e84ee5ddc12fe0218","role":"current_working_draft_packet","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:acb2351e84ee5ddc12fe0218","source_type":"protocol_full_draft_selection","source_version":"full-draft:c315238e8975745fc5500ae52859c14372253487b00aa4718f4224a279fcb0b5:a